[{"type": "subtitle", "time": 28381.788, "timestamp": "07:53:01", "text": "哦，等等。那是地下室。  等待。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 28387.99, "timestamp": "07:53:07", "text": "我認為在下面。是的。我的天啊。我的天啊。我很害怕。我很害怕。  我很害怕。我很害怕。"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 28407.83, "timestamp": "07:53:27", "text": "我竟然一點也不害怕。如何？"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 28425.83, "timestamp": "07:53:45", "text": "我覺得好像有東西掛在那裡。  哦，原來是隻飛蒼蠅。我的天啊。誰會說「我的天哪」。  我的天哪。 「"}, {"type": "subtitle", "time": 28431.35, "timestamp": "07:53:51", "text": "我們在這裡做什麼？」這個問題在哪裡？  我不知道"}, {"type": "chat", "time": 28439.506, "timestamp": "07:53:59", "author": "@MovieJunction909", "avatar": "https://yt4.ggpht.com/ytc/AIdro_mNkj4pW6jUvChG4gBzsrYlBtzdpsU-SuNMu6MPKVmDoCxY2_D05vAOfPJE2IATJUm0Sw=s64-c-k-c0x00ffffff-no-rj", "message": "oh, its the green haired girl😮"}]